@DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress = https://localhost:7177

### FORMAT > POST = Create, PUT = Update, DELETE = Delete, GET = Get All / Get By ID
### DELETE {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/DetailBahanBaku/BB0000017

### ============ ROLE PENGGUNA ============
### Get All
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/Role

### Get By ID
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/Role/R004

### Create
POST {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/Role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idRole": "R005",
  "namaRole": "Test Role"
}

### ============ MASTER PENGGUNA ============
### Get All
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/User

### Get By ID
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/User/U001

### Create
POST {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/User
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idUser": "U001",
  "idRole": "R001",
  "namaUser": "Admin",
  "password": "Admin123",
  "status": true
}

