### ============ MASTER MENU MAKANAN ============
### Get All
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/MenuMakanan

### Get By ID
GET {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/MenuMakanan/MN0000015

### Create
PUT {{DaffaCatering.API_HostAddress}}/api/MenuMakanan/MN0000015
